msgid ""
"Currently ArduPilot only supports telemetry on BLHeli or DroneCAN/CAN ESCs, "
"not throttle signal wire reported telemetry that some single unit ESCs "
"report."
msgstr ""
"目前 ArduPilot 仅支持 BLHeli 或 DroneCAN/CAN ESC 的数传，不支持部分单体 ESC 通过油门信号线报告的数传。"

